# Vercel CLI deploy ignores — only site/ matters for a root-context deploy.
# (rootDirectory=site handles Git-triggered deploys, which don't use this file.)
# IMPORTANT: anchor dir patterns with a leading `/` so they match ONLY the
# repo-root copies. An unanchored `docs/` also matched site/src/docs/ and
# silently dropped the /docs pages from CLI-from-root deploys (same for scripts/).
/src-tauri/
/src/
/public/
/data/
/dist/
/.claude/
/.ai/
/mcp-*/
/docs/
/scripts/
node_modules/
target/
*.db
*.exe
.tsbuildinfo
